# One checkout on every OS: text files are stored with LF in the repository and
# checked out with LF as well, so a Windows clone does not introduce CRLF churn
# (the console rewrites settings files, and .bat files are the only exception).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gguf binary
*.ico binary
